 "remarks": "Historic character meets refined modern design in this beautifully appointed one-bedroom plus den, two-bath residence at The Mill Westport. A gracious foyer provides a proper sense of arrival before opening into expansive living and entertaining spaces, where European white oak floors, historic replica windows, exposed brick, elegant lighting, and custom electric shades create a sophisticated backdrop. The open kitchen is outfitted with a suite of high-end appliances and an oversized island with generous seating, while a gas fireplace anchors the living room.  Thoughtfully designed to live like a true two-bedroom, a custom sliding glass wall creates a private second sleeping area complete with a deep closet and direct access to a full bath. The spacious primary suite is tucked away on the opposite side of the residence and features a pair of closets outfitted by Poliform and a luxurious five-fixture bath with a freestanding soaking tub, walk-in rain shower, and heated floors. A full-size washer and dryer, parking, and storage are all included.  Originally a historic candlewick mill dating to the 1800s, The Mill Westport has been thoughtfully reimagined as just 31 distinctive residences. Amenities include a pool and hot tub, fitness center, landscaped outdoor spaces, outdoor kitchen, residents' lounge, guest suite available for rent, and concierge services.",
